eability\n\n- **HLR-4 (P2)**: \"Documentation covers using the gallery and the\n  contribution process for new tutorials.\" This epic is the direct\n  implementation of HLR-4. Note: the epic's priority is P1 per the\n  docs-authoring priority exception, derived from the strategy's overall\n  priority (Major), not from the HLR's P2 label.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":46098,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a00f47e42199fa7","agent_id":"a9c35f164d8e7c9cb","session_id":"ef27924f-e37d-4918-8e80-2a9c242f8803","uuid":"bb8effc3-106a-4ab8-918a-dee11c633a7f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:26:22.652Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9019"}
