ent release and record the result.\n52\t- Keep the five tutorials consistent as one curated set (shared style,\n53\t  progression, and packaging).\n54\t\n55\tThe first-pipeline tutorial (the sixth journey) is authored separately by the\n56\tpipelines team; this epic covers the five notebook-centric journeys.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Five notebook tutorials exist covering the named journeys: first workbench,\n61\t  data prep, first training run, first deployment, and first RAG app.\n62\t- Each tutorial is packaged per the tutorial packaging format and passes the\n63\t  format's validation manifest.\n64\t- Each tutorial has a recorded successful test run against the current\n65\t  release.\n66\t- Each tutorial pins its images so it runs against known image versions.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- **HLR-2 (P0)**: \"Six curated tutorials exist covering the core journeys:\n71\t  first workbench, data prep, first training run, first pipeline, first\n72\t  deployment, first RAG app. Each is tested against the current release.\"\n73\t  This epic covers five of the six journeys (the notebook-centric ones); the\n74\t  first-pipeline journey is covered by the pipelines-team tutorial epic.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-92d45e8a6514990a","agent_id":"a4b7c8d14bf1c20bd","session_id":"ef27924f-e37d-4918-8e80-2a9c242f8803","uuid":"3c983ec2-b1a7-4f2e-a06f-9bef9b0312fc","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:32:25.467Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a771635c8cb6d7c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
