d to the curated set.\n54\t\n55\tOut of scope, mirroring the strategy: partner- or community-contributed\n56\ttutorial intake tooling (the process is documented, but no submission\n57\ttooling this release) and localization of tutorial content.\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- Published documentation covers using the gallery: opening it and launching\n62\t  both kinds of tutorial (workbench notebook and imported pipeline).\n63\t- Published documentation describes the contribution process for new\n64\t  tutorials, including the packaging format and the validation/testing\n65\t  requirements.\n66\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented gallery\n67\t  and tutorials and any discrepancies found in review are fixed.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- **HLR-4 (P2)**: \"Documentation covers using the gallery and the\n72\t  contribution process for new tutorials.\" This epic is the direct\n73\t  implementation of HLR-4. Note: the epic's priority is P1 per the\n74\t  docs-authoring priority exception, derived from the strategy's overall\n75\t  priority (Major), not from the HLR's P2 label.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-92d45e8a6514990a","agent_id":"a4b7c8d14bf1c20bd","session_id":"ef27924f-e37d-4918-8e80-2a9c242f8803","uuid":"04feabf5-93db-4988-ae7f-ca1050c16b2f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:32:26.956Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bee53764962182d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
